            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/yg150mb0559#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Pencil, the clearest hand in the batch: 1. 4. 1908. with the final 8 fully formed. The short word before the date is the same mark as on yr287jf4422 and is illegible to me; it begins with M or W and appears to carry an umlaut."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
